        "original_id": "56300693-e951-56b8-b902-fa687e4fde65",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milo Parker, Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka\n- Films: Robot Overlords, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Mr. Holmes, Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children\n- Roles: Connor, Roger Munro, Hugh Apiston, Hugo\n\nFacts:\n- Milo Parker, born in 2002, is a British child actor.\n- In the 2014 British independent science fiction film Robot Overlords, Milo Parker played Connor.\n- Robot Overlords was originally titled Our Robot Overlords and starred Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, and Gillian Anderson.\n- In the 2015 German-Austrian-Irish comedy film Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Milo Parker was one of the starring actors.\n- Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails starred Anke Engelke and Bastian Pastewka, with Pastewka providing the voice of Hugo.\n- Milo Parker is also known for playing Roger Munro in Mr. Holmes and Hugh Apiston in Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
